@startuml
skin rose
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
hide empty description
hide time-axis
robust ":Virus" as V
analog ":Temperature" between 0 and 40 as T
V has Execution,Triggering,Propagation,Dormant
@0
V is Dormant
T is 12
@10
T is 9
@20
V is Propagation
T is 16
@25
V is Triggering
@30
V is Execution
T is 28
@40
T is 32
@50
T is 24
@55
@enduml
